WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.410
A control panel with three
dials: fate, chance, people.

2
00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.820
A child looks up at the stars.

3
00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:11.860
"Which do we live on, a
splendid one or a blighted one?"

4
00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:14.740
Tess answers, "A blighted one."

5
00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.160
A letter vanishes under a rug.

6
00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:19.980
A cart lamp goes out on a dark road.

7
00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:22.030
A crowd turns its back.

8
00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:24.890
The needles swing, and never settle.

9
00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:29.880
So what destroys Tess: fate,
chance, or other people?

10
00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:33.170
In this mission, you'll hear
a narrator who keeps asking,

11
00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.480
"where was Tess’s guardian angel?"

12
00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:39.820
You'll track the accidents, like a
confession that slips under a carpet.

13
00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:45.240
And you'll see what Darwin, in
1859, did to the idea of a plan.

14
00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:48.670
Your mission: decide what destroys Tess.
